Wurmslayer	29	{"kind":"item","title":"Wurmslayer","wikiPath":"/Wurmslayer","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Dragon Scales Quest"}],"components":[],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Wurmslayer","icon":"https://eqlwiki.com/images/8/86/Item_736.png","lines":["MAGIC ITEM","Slot: PRIMARY","Skill: 1H Slashing Atk Delay: 40","DMG: 25 AC: 5","STR: +5","SV MAGIC: +5","WT: 15.0 Size: GIANT","Class: WAR PAL RNG SHD","Race: ALL","DMG Bonus: 20 @ lvl 50"]},"fetchedAt":"2026-10-27T05:39:25.993Z","outOfEra":true}
Wenglawks The Traitor	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Wenglawks The Traitor","wikiPath":"/Wenglawks_The_Traitor","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Kael Drakkel","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Fjokar Frozenshard","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Frozen Shard","item":"Frozen Shard","wikiPath":"/Frozen_Shard"}],"steps":[{"parts":["Fjokar is seeking a Sealed Letter dropped by a Shardwing Courier in the Western Wastelands. On handing in the letter:"],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with Kromzek got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with KingTormax got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with DainFrostreaverIV got worse."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with Yelinak could not possibly get any worse."],"steps":[]}]},{"parts":["You receive a ",{"title":"Frozen Shard"},"."],"steps":[]}],"card":{"title":"Wenglawks The Traitor","lines":["Minimum Level: 45","Classes: Rogue","Related Zones: Western Wastes","Related NPCs: Shardwing Courier"]},"links":["Kael Drakkel","Fjokar Frozenshard","Rogue","Western Wastes","Shardwing Courier","Frozen Shard","Affliction","Sealed Letter"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Fjokar Frozenshard","text":"Today is a good day in Kael Drakkel. Don't you think?"},{"npc":"Fjokar Frozenshard","text":"Wenglawks masquerades as a noble. As family lines go, his is even more diluted than those two Iceshard brothers. He is a petty merchant and traitor. One day I will find my proof of this."},{"npc":"Fjokar Frozenshard","text":"Klaggan and Vorken, those two ruffians who somehow have managed to become the lords of the Kromrif manor. They were nothing but a pair of thugs no less than twenty years ago. I remember watching them kill and maim the innocent among the Kromrif tribes. If it were not for King Tormax's protection, I would slay them."},{"npc":"Fjokar Frozenshard","text":"The Frost giants are a proud race, but they are not nearly as powerful and blessed as we Kromzek. Our cousins may be strong, but the might of an enraged storm giant is something to behold."},{"npc":"Fjokar Frozenshard","text":"Those Kromzek deserve to die. They know very well what he is up to. I will hunt them for sport, moving silently through the streets of Kael Drakkel, and invisibly through the outside world. Wenglawks has some sort of underhanded deals going on with the dragons. I have yet to find anything which will persuade King Tormax to allow me to slay him, unfortunately."},{"npc":"Fjokar Frozenshard","text":"You have found what I was unable to. King Tormax's protection of Wenglawks will end soon. His death will be so very delightful to invoke.' Fjokar rushes out of the room, dropping his spear as he does."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-27T05:39:27.073Z","outOfEra":true}
