Lydl Mastat	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Lydl Mastat","wikiPath":"/Lydl_Mastat","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"West Freeport","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Hemia Skemner","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Locked Book","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Locked_Book"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Faction","item":"Faction","wikiPath":"/Faction"},{"text":"Coin"}],"card":{"title":"Lydl Mastat","lines":["Minimum Level: 5","Classes: ?","Related Zones: East Freeport","Related NPCs: Lydl the Great","Required Faction: Amiable or better"]},"links":["Freeport","Hemia Skemner","Lydl the Great","Faction","Dismal Rage","Knights of Truth","Opal Darkbriar","Locked Book","Arcane Scientists","The Freeport Militia"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Hemia Skemner","text":"How are you? Welcome to the Academy of Arcane Science. Please feel free to roam. May knowledge be your goal. Be you a [fellow scientist] or visitor, I am sure you will find whatever you seek."},{"npc":"Hemia Skemner","text":"That is good. I hope you can handle the knowledge of arcane science. Some have gone mad conducting research. Such a person is [Lydl Mastat]."},{"npc":"Hemia Skemner","text":"Lydl Mastat is nothing more than a young apprentice of mine. He went mad working on a formula for deep water breathing. He now roams the outskirts of Freeport boasting of power he does not have. Someone should [teach Lydl a lesson]."},{"npc":"Hemia Skemner","text":"Then go. He appears near the gates of Freeport from time to time. He is not powerful, but he has a secret. Nothing save magic can harm him. This was the result of an experimental potion he drank. Slay him and return his locked spellbook to me."},{"npc":"Lydl the Great","text":"Death to you all! Swords cannot harm a mighty follower of Innoruuk!"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T06:02:50.045Z","outOfEra":false}
